    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "8.培養學生運用資料調查、數據分析或數學模型分析運輸或物流問題之能力",
      "describe_en": "8.To develop  students' ability to analyze transportation and logistics problem using data investigation, data analysis or mathematical models."
    },
